        "anchor": [
          0,
          7087.5,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "Eight tokens cost 57.7 ms against 53.7 ms for one, since the weight read is the same. From 128 on, past\nthe ridge, the time grows with B, where the roofline put it.",
      "originalText": "Eight tokens cost 57.7 ms against 53.7 ms for one, since the weight read is the same. From 128 on, past\nthe ridge, the time grows with B, where the roofline put it.",
