      "text": "by 256 sequences every expert is read; past that each\nsequence adds 142.8 GFLOP for 0.288 GB of its own KV,\na ceiling of about 496 FLOP per byte at 4,096 context",
      "originalText": "by 256 sequences every expert is read; past that each\nsequence adds 142.8 GFLOP for 0.288 GB of its own KV,\na ceiling of about 496 FLOP per byte at 4,096 context",
