        "section": "9-deepseek",
        "anchor": [
          1400,
          12359,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "batch 1 reads 36.63 GB of weights a token. If one GPU had to\nread it, that takes 4.6 ms at a B200's 8 TB/s and 10.9 ms\nat an H100's 3.35 TB/s (NVIDIA's figures)",
      "originalText": "batch 1 reads 36.63 GB of weights a token. If one GPU had to\nread it, that takes 4.6 ms at a B200's 8 TB/s and 10.9 ms\nat an H100's 3.35 TB/s (NVIDIA's figures)",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
