        "anchor": [
          1400,
          12499,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "V3 in FP8 is about 671 GB and fits on no single GPU. Matmul weights counted at FP8,\nthough V3 keeps its output head in BF16, about 0.9 GB more. Our arithmetic from V3's\nconfig.json, uniform routing: bytes and FLOPs, not timings",
      "originalText": "V3 in FP8 is about 671 GB and fits on no single GPU. Matmul weights counted at FP8,\nthough V3 keeps its output head in BF16, about 0.9 GB more. Our arithmetic from V3's\nconfig.json, uniform routing: bytes and FLOPs, not timings",
